# Refusals (spec 031 AC-3, FR-14, FR-15): a broken map is refused by the build and the game keeps the old room (the same
# self-check line is not logged again: nothing was applied); a valid map after it is applied; a changed schema source
# is an input of the program: nnh refuses it before sending anything ("rebuild and restart"). The source tree is unchanged
# afterwards.
expect "reload: sum 2B7C6114 after 0" 90
wait 10
swap-asset assets/levels/room.tmj fixtures/room_broken.tmj
expect-reload levels/room refused
wait 10
screenshot broken_kept
swap-asset assets/levels/room.tmj fixtures/room_moved.tmj
expect-reload levels/room
expect "reload: sum * after 1" 5
wait 10
swap-asset data_types.cpp fixtures/data_types_changed.cpp
expect-reload refused
wait 10
end
